as above.\n\nNothing is added on top: there are no ERP, toll or airport-surcharge lines, so no pass-through correction arises and nothing is double-counted. The residual is not a 'material' deviation on the adjusted figures (5.54 km, about 32.9% of the adjusted optimal, below both the 50% and 8.0 km gates), and the driver profile shows no repeat-deviation pattern (0 flags in 90 days), so no conduct referral and no full-refund uplift follows. The monetary effect of SGD 6.15 is below the SGD 8.00 automatic-execution threshold, so it is released without a human queue step.",
